 "notes": "95%-credible upper limits on dark-photon kinetic mixing parameter \u03c7 from geomagnetic field measurements. Extracted the light-blue 'This signal, smoothed' curve from Figure 4 using visual analysis of PDF rendering. Converted from pixel coordinates using axis label calibration (x-axis: mass m_A' [eV] from 3\u00d710^-18 to 6\u00d710^-17; y-axis: \u03c7 from 10^-2 to ~10^-6). Used upper envelope of the confidence band and spline smoothing (s=0.8) to generate the final curve. Mass range searched: 2\u00d710^-18 to 7\u00d710^-17 eV (corresponding to 6\u00d710^-11 to 2\u00d710^-5 Hz). Signal assumed to be all of dark-matter density (~0.3 GeV/cm\u00b3). No robust signal candidates identified; limits shown are from posterior distribution analysis of geomagnetic data. Extraction includes ~30 local oscillations in the smoothed curve due to noise in the confidence band; conservative estimate accounts for this uncertainty.",
